            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I understand that this is a huge nit-pick, but could you please:\n- Not use \"foo\", \"bar\", \"baz\", etc. For some reason I really dislike them. A repeated character like `fff` (or just `f` in this case) is usually more descriptive about being a single intended part.\n- Although I understand the intention of spreading over multiple lines, could you please collapse the whole array into one line? If it doesn't fit, truncate the tested lines (does three lines is needed or it is possible to use only 2 or 1 to test the behavior?). Otherwise it accumulates into a very significant diff.",
